# If the focused Overdue entry was completed by another program while the app was closed, the view opens on another entry.
file <<END
- First @due({today-3})
- Second @due({today-2})
END
keys gO j
see ▌ - Second
quit
outside <<END
- First @due({today-3})
- Second @due({today-2}) @done({today})
END
restart
see Overdue
see ▌ - First
hide Second
